rs","src":"National Association of Wholesaler-Distributors","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNRXVjbXFfVnNLclB5Um9Ma3RXTXdJUHRqWkpJbjE5MGpIWjZ1cUl0ZDdBcW14V2lkSUtJb1N2c3c2dDNGV2ZtYmlQZ2pCUHJmNHdDLUs0U0ZGOExIdEM3N3VTejF1a3dJb01STV9wb2YzRnpTLWxiRnJMQ3FGamFvalFlT2dLZW9xZWc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"最後在一起：Cintas 以 $5.5B 收購 UniFirst - 全國批發分銷商協會"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"併購","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-07-29","period":"2026-05-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723254/000072325426000028/ctas-20260531.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Cintas Corporation (Cintas, Company, we, us or our), a Washington corporation, helps more than one million businesses of all types and sizes, primarily in the United States (U.S.), as well as Canada and Latin America, get READY to open their doors with confidence every day by providing a wide range of products and services that enhance our customers' image and help keep their facilities and employees clean, safe and looking their best. With products and services including uniforms, mats, mops, shop towels, restroom supplies, workplace water services, first aid and safety products, automated external defibrillators (AEDs), eye-wash stations, safety training, fire extinguishers, sprinkler systems and alarm testing, Cintas helps customers get Ready for the Workday . Cintas was founded in 1968 by Richard T. Farmer when he left his family's industrial laundry business in order to develop unif","zh":"Cintas Corporation（Cintas、Company、我們、我們或我們的）是一家位於華盛頓的公司，透過提供廣泛的產品和服務來提升客戶形象，並幫助他們的設施和員工保持清潔、安全和最佳狀態，幫助超過 100 萬家各種類型和規模的企業（主要位於美國、加拿大和拉丁美洲）做好每天充滿信心地開門營業的準備。 Cintas 提供的產品和服務包括制服、墊子、拖把、毛巾、衛生間用品、工作場所供水服務、急救和安全產品、自動體外心臟去顫器 (AED)、洗眼站、安全培訓、滅火器、灑水系統和警報測試，幫助客戶為工作日做好準備。 Cintas 由 Richard T. Farmer 於 1968 年創立，當時他離開了家族的工業洗衣業務，以發展統一的洗衣業務。"},{"en":"Cintas' reportable operating segments are the Uniform Rental and Facility Services operating segment and the First Aid and Safety Services operating segment. The Uniform Rental and Facility Services reportable operating segment consists of the rental and servicing of uniforms and other garments, including flame resistant clothing, mats, mops and shop towels and other ancillary items. In addition to these rental items, restroom cleaning services and supplies and the sale of items from our catalogs to our customers on route are included within this reportable operating segment. The First Aid and Safety Services reportable operating segment consists of first aid and safety products and services, as well as workplace water services. The remainder of Cintas' business, which consists of the Fire Protection Services operating segment and the Uniform Direct Sale operating segment, is included in","zh":"Cintas 的可報告營運分部為制服租賃和設施服務營運分部以及急救和安全服務營運分部。制服租賃和設施服務可報告經營分部包括制服和其他服裝的租賃和服務，包括阻燃服裝、墊子、拖把和抹布以及其他輔助物品。除這些租賃物品外，衛生間清潔服務和用品​​以及向途中客戶銷售我們目錄中的物品也包含在該可報告經營分部內。急救和安全服務可報告經營部門包括急救和安全產品和服務，以及工作場所供水服務。 Cintas 的其餘業務（包括消防服務營運部門和統一直銷營運部門）包含在"},{"en":"The following table sets forth Cintas' total revenue and the revenue derived from each reportable operating segment and the remaining operating segments included in All Other for the fiscal years ended May 31:","zh":"下表列出了截至 5 月 31 日財年 Cintas 的總收入以及來自每個可報告經營分部以及包含在「所有其他」中的其餘經營分部的收入："}],"markets":[{"en":"Cintas' reportable operating segments are the Uniform Rental and Facility Services operating segment and the First Aid and Safety Services operating segment. The Uniform Rental and Facility Services reportable operating segment consists of the rental and servicing of uniforms and other garments, including flame resistant clothing, mats, mops and shop towels and other ancillary items. In addition to these rental items, restroom cleaning services and supplies and the sale of items from our catalogs to our customers on route are included within this reportable operating segment. The First Aid and Safety Services reportable operating segment consists of first aid and safety products and services, as well as workplace water services. The remainder of Cintas' business, which consists of the Fire Protection Services operating segment and the Uniform Direct Sale operating segment, is included in","zh":"Cintas 的可报告运营分部为制服租赁和设施服务运营分部以及急救和安全服务运营分部。制服租賃和設施服務可報告經營分部包括制服和其他服裝的租賃和服務，包括阻燃服裝、墊子、拖把和抹布以及其他輔助物品。除這些租賃物品外，衛生間清潔服務和用品​​以及向途中客戶銷售我們目錄中的物品也包含在該可報告經營分部內。急救和安全服务可报告经营部门包括急救和安全产品和服务，以及工作场所供水服务。 Cintas 的其余业务（包括消防服务运营部门和统一直销运营部门）包含在"},{"en":"The following table sets forth Cintas' total revenue and the revenue derived from each reportable operating segment and the remaining operating segments included in All Other for the fiscal years ended May 31:","zh":"下表列出了截至 5 月 31 日財年 Cintas 的總收入以及來自每個可報告經營分部以及包含在「所有其他」中的其餘經營分部的收入："}],"customers":[{"en":"We provide our products and services to over one million businesses of all types, from small service and manufacturing companies to major corporations that employ thousands of people. This diversity in customer base results in no individual customer accounting for greater than one percent of Cintas' total revenue. As a result, the loss of one account would not have a material financial impact on Cintas.","zh":"我們為超過一百萬家各類企業提供產品和服務，從小型服務和製造公司到擁有數千名員工的大型公司。客戶群的這種多樣性導致單一客戶的收入佔 Cintas 總收入的比例不超過 1%。因此，遺失一個帳戶不會對 Cintas 產生重大財務影響。"},{"en":"The primary markets served by each of the Cintas operating segments are local in nature and highly fragmented. Cintas competes with national, regional and local providers, large national retailers and small local retailers as well as companies with a significant online presence and the level of competition varies at each of Cintas' local","zh":"Cintas 各營運部門所服務的主要市場本質上都是本地市場且高度分散。 Cintas 與國家、區域和當地供應商、大型全國零售商和小型當地零售商以及擁有大量線上業務的公司競爭，並且每個 Cintas 當地的競爭水平各不相同"}],"competition":[{"en":"The primary markets served by each of the Cintas operating segments are local in nature and highly fragmented. Cintas competes with national, regional and local providers, large national retailers and small local retailers as well as companies with a significant online presence and the level of competition varies at each of Cintas' local","zh":"Cintas 各營運部門所服務的主要市場本質上都是本地市場且高度分散。 Cintas 與國家、區域和當地供應商、大型全國零售商和小型當地零售商以及擁有大量線上業務的公司競爭，並且每個 Cintas 當地的競爭水平各不相同"},{"en":"operations. In addition, businesses may decide to perform certain services in-house instead of outsourcing these services. Product, design, price, quality, service and convenience to the customer are the competitive elements in each of our operating segments.","zh":"營運.此外，企業可能決定在內部提供某些服務，而不是外包這些服務。產品、設計、價格、品質、服務和為客戶提供的便利性是我們每個營運部門的競爭要素。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"Uniform Rental & Facility Services","val":8621624000,"zh":"制服租賃和設施服務部門"},{"name":"First Aid & Safety Services","val":1391853000,"zh":"急救與安全服務部門"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":1251284000,"zh":"所有其他部門"},{"name":"Fire Protection Services","val":929142000,"zh":"消防服務部門"},{"name":"Uniform Direct Sales","val":322142000,"zh":"統一直銷部門"}],"total":11264761000},"prod":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"Uniform Rental & Facility Services","val":8621624000,"zh":"制服租賃和設施服務部門"},{"name":"Other Products & Services","val":2643137000,"zh":"其他產品和服務"}],"total":11264761000}},"peers":["GWW","DOV","CINF","ROP","ECL"]}}